s","name":"大月川泥流堆積物","category":"nature","address":"火山景観 / 流れ山群","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"20303","municipality_pref":"長野県","municipality_name":"小海町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"106"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[138.4287872314453,36.05031204223633]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"楯子湯","category":"nature","address":"火山景観 / 噴泉","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"20303","municipality_pref":"長野県","municipality_name":"小海町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"111"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[138.39886474609375,36.04281997680664]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"松原湖","category":"nature","address":"湖沼景観 / 湖沼","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"20303","municipality_pref":"長野県","municipality_name":"小海町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"701"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[138.45663452148438,36.05295944213867]}}],"display_comment_original":"小海町周辺には、近世村の記憶として小海村、稲子村、稲子新田村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には城跡や陣屋跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、海尻城跡、神光寺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では小海村、稲子村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":[],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["松原湖","白駒の池","みどり池","天狗岳","小海高原美術館","ギャラリー創","松原湖温泉","小海リエックススキー場"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B5%B7%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"小海町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110851940","wikidata_qid":"Q1204222","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%B5%B7%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}